  "title": "Pork Chops with Apple Cider Glaze",
  "description": "Pork chops with a glossy apple cider glaze is really easy, and while there&#39;s no starch or extra butter involved, it reduces quickly to a thick, rich, sweet-tart apple syrup.",
  "authors": [
